  "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/abnormal-ai-amazon-bedrock-agentcore-for-agentic-email-security-at-scale/",
  "sourceTitle": "Abnormal AI: Amazon Bedrock AgentCore for agentic email security at scale",
  "sourceBodyHash": "2fd3db415a6c7756a1050e3590149e70b8fa299c0408dda267e0cf0baa547eb8",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-15T00:27:36.531468Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-03T15:18:45.648502Z",
  "totalBlocks": 66,
  "translatedBlocks": 66,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "60b1286d1c7d8a80",
      "translationZh": "AI 代理现在每天在生产环境中以数十亿次操作的规模运行，并且出现了一种反复出现的架构模式：代理需要一个计算临时存储区。不仅用于编码任务，还用于数据聚合、分析、验证以及任何仅靠语义推理不足以完成的工作流。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86df8ad1c23be8e8",
      "translationZh": "Abnormal AI 是一项保护超过 25% 福布斯 500 强企业的行为安全服务，已部署 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Code Interpreter（Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的一项功能）。Abnormal AI 将其用于支持其实时内联电子邮件威胁检测的代理。这些系统目前在生产环境中运行，每日处理数十亿条消息，并以相同的规模执行代理驱动的代码，以在消息进入收件箱之前实时检测并阻止威胁。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "217d3db9286231ee",
      "translationZh": "这项工作是 Abnormal AI 构建软件方式的一部分。如今，他们 80% 的代码更改是通过某种方式使用代理构建的，而 40% 的代码是由后台代理端到端构建的（完全由 AI 构建，而非 AI 辅助）。他们在威胁检测中使用 AgentCore Code Interpreter 体现了相同的 AI 原生方法，该方法已应用于他们的生产运行时。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "901600c8c1200fae",
      "translationZh": "在这篇文章中，我们将分享 Abnormal AI 如何构建这些系统的架构、其沙箱方法背后的设计决策，以及为大规模部署 Code Interpreter 的构建者提供的实用经验。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "53f3cb4b187dbc05",
      "translationZh": "什么是 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Code Interpreter？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "834edef09449402f",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Code Interpreter 提供了一个完全托管的、无服务器的运行时，供代理动态执行代码。主要特性包括：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a9afd79667b97612",
      "translationZh": "临时 MicroVM 会话：可配置的生存时间（TTL）从 15 分钟（默认）到 8 小时，用于长时间运行的任务。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "af377939baa4dfce",
      "translationZh": "安全：会话在安全的沙箱中运行，在主机操作系统级别实现完全隔离，旨在帮助防止会话之间的意外泄露。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1a1067e500838cf3",
      "translationZh": "灵活的网络：可配置为沙盒虚拟私有云（VPC）模式，或公共互联网访问。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2f3b8d787b48991b",
      "translationZh": "文件处理：通过 API 直接最多可达 100 MB，或连接到 Amazon Simple Storage Service（Amazon S3）以处理更大的数据集。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9498ff942fd8dce9",
      "translationZh": "预加载运行时：包含常见可视化、统计和数据处理库的 Python 和 Node.js 环境。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fb380a52a3222ae4",
      "translationZh": "内置可观测性：日志发送至 Amazon CloudWatch 和 AWS CloudTrail 以进行监控。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db2c10a31d93be94",
      "translationZh": "关键的是，Code Interpreter 以 API 的形式暴露。这意味着它不会规定代理的工作流。相反，它提供了一个框，代理可以在其中运行命令、上传文件并检索结果。对于已有代理基础设施的团队，这种即插即用的设计使得集成变得直接。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "39fa6261e48b76ff",
      "translationZh": "图 1：Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Code Interpreter 架构，其中代理调用 Code Interpreter API 来配置临时 MicroVM 沙盒会话，用于代码执行、文件输入和输出以及结果检索。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "664b785af7e3965a",
      "translationZh": "为什么代理需要一个计算暂存区",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "44640ed9f6758139",
      "translationZh": "大型语言模型（LLM）在推理和语义连贯性方面表现出色，但许多真实世界的操作并不映射到语义推理：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f798b4f55d70d5fd",
      "translationZh": "基本数学和计数：“我们在过去一小时内检测到多少封钓鱼邮件？”需要计算，而不是语言生成。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "06a1491f620000dd",
      "translationZh": "数据处理和可视化：将原始数据转换为图表、PDF 或结构化报告。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c18f9472e131d2d8",
      "translationZh": "代码验证：运行单元测试、linting 和集成测试以验证代理生成的输出。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4789f065649a8a1e",
      "translationZh": "通过将大型语言模型与 Code Interpreter 配对，您可以增强代理的能力，超越仅靠推理所能达到的水平。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2cd3a8ceafd6f591",
      "translationZh": "“几乎任何代理，无论是否编写代码，都需要一个代码解释器沙箱，使其能够实际处理数据并得出答案。”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ed6985831a68126",
      "translationZh": "— Shrivu Shankar，Abnormal AI 人工智能战略副总裁",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e6e2ac9ba394e470",
      "translationZh": "Abnormal AI 的架构：十亿级邮件规模的三层检测",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e4f53e76782f36b",
      "translationZh": "Abnormal AI 通过三层检测架构处理数十亿封电子邮件消息，如图 2 所示。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e33ba9271513449c",
      "translationZh": "图 2：Abnormal AI 的三层电子邮件检测管道，其中第 1 层（heuristics，每日数十亿），第 2 层（machine learning models，每日数百万），第 3 层（带有 Code Interpreter 的内联代理，每日数万），每层处理前一层不确定的逐渐更难的案例。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "925d6367770ca342",
      "translationZh": "第 1 层 — 高容量轻量级分类（每日数十亿）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d937d8762c0889f3",
      "translationZh": "Small models、heuristic rules、lightweight classifiers (logistic regressions) 处理最大流量。在此规模下，运行更大的模型既成本过高又不必要。大多数消息可以在不进行深度分析的情况下进行分类。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "22cf1cbc18eb06d4",
      "translationZh": "第 2 层 — 中等模型用于不确定的案例（每日数百万）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a2e0ec7d674e7ee2",
      "translationZh": "第 1 层不确定的消息会流入深度学习和机器学习（ML）模型，这些模型执行更多的行为信号分析。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "61bf7586b2c55fcd",
      "translationZh": "第 3 层 — 带有 Code Interpreter 的内联代理（每日数万）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dca9c7d3896d5cbc",
      "translationZh": "最难的案例通常需要人工分析师进行评估，这些案例由 inline agents 处理。这些代理接收 threat intelligence data 并使用 sandbox 进行分析，动态编写脚本。然后他们评估其如何融入整体 behavioral model 并作出判断。Misclassifications 由一个独立的系统处理，该系统会学习并改进整体系统。多种 monitoring systems 验证实时系统。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7dfd4e713e158454",
      "translationZh": "分析师代理 — 批量情报",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0626e9b419e1909e",
      "translationZh": "除了图 2 所示的实时分类流水线之外，Abnormal 还部署了一个以批处理模式运行的分析代理（图 3）：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c4e60d053f354d9b",
      "translationZh": "从其检测管道中摄取误分类和调优信号。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a4b015b5f9267285",
      "translationZh": "在大规模消息集合中识别模式和趋势。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c20c8a31241c3c0b",
      "translationZh": "自主为 Tier 1 编写候选启发式草稿，在 Abnormal AI 自身的检测管道特征和信号上运行。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "085e81fbeb36000c",
      "translationZh": "Tier 2 的改进模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c58352754a2bd5e1",
      "translationZh": "每周大约运行 100 个批处理作业的规模。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1fbbe5bb68acf54",
      "translationZh": "图 3：分析代理反馈循环，其中批处理代理从实时管道摄取误分类，使用 Code Interpreter 会话分析模式，并将改进的启发式和模型反馈回 Tier 1 和 Tier 2。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ac3fd8760931dd1",
      "translationZh": "这些批处理作业可以在整个过程中保持 Code Interpreter 会话，运行时间超过 30 分钟。它们也可以跨越一天的操作，期间代理间歇性地使用 Code Interpreter。例如，它会运行一个会话，在外部训练一个模型，然后重新调用 Code Interpreter 来处理结果。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fbbe1443eadd5fd2",
      "translationZh": "安全：零信任沙盒设计",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc133278fab30e86",
      "translationZh": "Abnormal 选择了 Code Interpreter 的沙盒（无外出）配置，这是由两个考虑因素驱动的：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "57116748980a9018",
      "translationZh": "可重复性 – 由于沙盒没有外部网络访问，Abnormal AI 控制之外的任何事物都无法在此会话中影响代理的行为。该环境被设计为完全确定性。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6891d948201ee267",
      "translationZh": "数据外泄防护 – 威胁情报数据进入沙盒进行分析。即使代理通过提示注入或随机行为变得恶意，它也被设计为防止将该数据外泄到互联网。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "15ed6d94be1559e8",
      "translationZh": "其他安全实践：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e86fae5cd0c11995",
      "translationZh": "受控数据摄入：有意选择进入 Code Interpreter 的数据类型以及允许的写操作。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c5a78fd10eb7910b",
      "translationZh": "子处理器对齐：Code Interpreter 在现有的 AWS 子处理器关系下运行，降低合规开销。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "102c0dcdd905b6b0",
      "translationZh": "网络隔离分层：沙盒隔离建立在他们现有的网络隔离 harness 之上，提供纵深防御。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "909fd5ba9badc77c",
      "translationZh": "经验教训和最佳实践",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f905afdd828151b8",
      "translationZh": "几种实践在 Abnormal AI 的生产环境中运行 Code Interpreter 时浮现出来。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0676e96596dab846",
      "translationZh": "1. 给予代理它想要的",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "87c84862eb0aaca0",
      "translationZh": "代理在使用轻量级通用套件而不是僵化的逐步工作流时表现更好。提供解决问题的高级原则，让代理利用其智能来确定方法。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5821df5db25ccdf0",
      "translationZh": "2. 每个代理都需要一个 scratch pad",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "61aa86604dbcae70",
      "translationZh": "Code Interpreter 不仅仅用于编码代理。分析邮件的安全代理受益于使用计算 scratch pad 进行数据聚合、模式分析和验证。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "84ac44bd0c436e6b",
      "translationZh": "3. 使用 programmatic verifiers 作为 guardrails",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ede397c74198e3d6",
      "translationZh": "当代理拥有程序化验证工具时，他们能够交付更高质量的输出。单元测试、集成测试和 linting 使代理能够在沙盒内自测，然后再交付最终结果。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "37fc5eadf7246c9b",
      "translationZh": "4. 将文件系统用作长时间运行任务的恢复点",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de4df8226d6b67e6",
      "translationZh": "对于超过 Code Interpreter 会话时间的操作（例如，模型训练），使用文件系统作为检查点。运行 Code Interpreter 进行计算，将状态持久化到文件，在外部执行长时间运行的操作，然后重新调用 Code Interpreter 处理结果。分析代理（图 3）将此模式用于一天长的模型训练操作。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42d76f21c24427c6",
      "translationZh": "Abnormal AI 的实现展示了生产代理系统的一个关键见解：Code Interpreter 不仅仅是一个编码工具。它是代理用于进行计算推理的基本基础设施。通过将 AgentCore Code Interpreter 的托管安全沙箱与他们自己的轻量级代理 harness 结合，Abnormal 实现：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8e9ffe7b6f59ca1d",
      "translationZh": "Zero-trust 安全态势通过沙箱隔离实现，有助于防止数据外泄。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ae225bb495476aff",
      "translationZh": "Billion-message 规模通过为最困难的情况保留代理计算资源实现（图 2）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d6c21589f789241",
      "translationZh": "无论您是在构建安全代理还是需要代理处理数据并验证其自身输出的系统，这种模式都很明确。为您的代理提供一个 scratch pad，并更信任他们的评估而非他们的断言。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a5104e3ba463a394",
      "translationZh": "开始使用 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Code Interpreter。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "089a58727894b207",
      "translationZh": "探索 AgentCore 的功能以及其他工具（Gateway、Memory、Runtime、Identity）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3bcb428158d726b4",
      "translationZh": "了解有关 Abnormal AI 的更多信息，请访问 abnormalsecurity.com。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
